strategy_refresh_2026_06_28:
  source: https://uaix.org/en-us/tools/ai-memory-package-wizard/#setup-file-handoff
  applied_shape: Active Content and Improvement buckets are live intake; every reviewed file needs disposition, proof-of-use, durable raw/wiki/docs preservation, hot routing, pointer-ledger refresh, report/research pointer audit, and source-site removal unless an explicit keep-active reason or blocker is recorded.
  startup_loop: Open project root, scan active buckets, preserve durable bodies, refresh `.uai` routing, refresh long-term checksums, expose current routes from short-term memory, remove processed source-site copies from active intake unless keep-active is explicitly requested or blocked, then continue implementation work.
  report_memory_rule: Reports stay as durable raw evidence plus wiki/report synthesis bodies; .uai files keep current routing, synthesis, proof pointers, and checksums.
  research_memory_rule: Research/reference bodies stay under wiki/runtime-mirust/research/; hot .uai files carry routing, implementation boundaries, and next-step prompts; long-term memory carries checksum pointers.
  short_term_reference_rule: .uai/short-term-memory.uai records current report indexes, research reference routes, active bucket disposition, and the long-term ledger route after each intake or strategy refresh.
  report_pointer_audit_rule: After report or research memory changes, audit wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/*.md and wiki/runtime-mirust/research/*.md against .uai/long-term-memory.uai before calling the handoff complete.
  diverse_model_breeding_reference_rule: Model Breeding ideas route through durable research lanes for compatible merges, sparse lineage, adapter ecology, population search, federated/local updates, browser-constrained assembly, UAIX memory strategy, heritable artifacts, mate selection, phenotype evidence, fit boundaries, genome/fitness/novelty/speciation metadata, and zero-dependency browser-runtime guidance.
  tiny_model_runtime_memory_reference_rule_2026_06_29: Tiny-model and Rust/WASM runtime research routes through raw/runtime-mirust/report-intake-2026-06-29/, wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/report-intake-index-2026-06-29.md, and wiki/runtime-mirust/research/tiny-model-runtime-memory-reference-ideas-2026-06-29.md before model-conversion, browser-runtime, or memory-strategy work.
  safetensors_tokenizer_budget_reference_rule_2026_06_29: Follow-up safetensors, tokenizer, browser byte-budget, WASM hot-loop, model-breeding metadata, and reference-output fixture research routes through raw/runtime-mirust/report-intake-2026-06-29-followup/, wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/report-intake-index-2026-06-29-followup.md, and wiki/runtime-mirust/research/safetensors-tokenizer-budget-reference-ideas-2026-06-29.md before conversion, tokenizer, budget, or fixture work.
  voice_memory_rule: Public-copy voice routes through .uai/taboo.uai before model-breeding, mutualist, tiny-ecology, or UAIX strategy copy is published; use proof, craft, lineage, fit, local agency, routes, and implementation evidence.
