  source: https://uaix.org/en-us/tools/ai-memory-package-wizard/#setup-file-handoff
  reviewed_utc: 2026-06-30T23:58:00Z
  failure: Prior memory incorrectly promoted `kept-active-with-reason` into the default post-processing rule, leaving processed reports in active intake after durable preservation.
  corrected_rule: Remove processed source-site copies from active intake after durable preservation and proof-of-use; use `kept-active-with-reason` only for an explicit named keep-active request or a blocker.
  disposition: preserved-to-durable-memory
  proof: Nine Improvement reports were copied byte-for-byte to docs/report-intake/2026-06-30/ with SHA256 verification, then removed from agent-file-handoff/Improvement/; current scan sees Content=0 and Improvement=0.
  next_agent_action: Treat non-placeholder files in Content/Improvement as pending intake; do not call handoff complete until each has disposition, proof-of-use, durable preservation when accepted, and source-site removal or a real keep-active blocker.
